From 87c985ed4e04221b7766dcd1b1843b0094915689 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Freevatar <freevatar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:44:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm: run forced connector probes outside the realtime thread

Forced connector query can exceed RLIMIT_RTTIME in one ioctl and kill compositor before its SIGXCPU handler can run

Run queries synchronously through a persistent SCHED_OTHER worker
---
 CMakeLists.txt                     |  12 ++
 src/backend/drm/ConnectorProbe.cpp | 125 ++++++++++++++++
 src/backend/drm/ConnectorProbe.hpp |  64 ++++++++
 src/backend/drm/DRM.cpp            |  13 +-
 tests/ConnectorProbe.cpp           | 229 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 437 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/backend/drm/ConnectorProbe.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/backend/drm/ConnectorProbe.hpp
 create mode 100644 tests/ConnectorProbe.cpp

